(7518220, 1201077, 59029, '<td valign="top">good one Art! 8 for making me smile</td>', 'good one Art! 8 for making me smile', '2017-06-10 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7518420, 1201026, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very clever, deliciously confounding, beautiful monochrome textures and tones: a dazzling concept confidently executed.  Hard to argue with that recipe.  Maybe something here is a wee bit <i>too</i> much, but I can''t decide what it is, so maybe it isn''t. It''s <i>interesting</i>, and that always trumps everything. 8. Thank you</td>', 'Very clever, deliciously confounding, beautiful monochrome textures and tones: a dazzling concept confidently executed.  Hard to argue with that recipe.  Maybe something here is a wee bit too much, but I can''t decide what it is, so maybe it isn''t. It''s interesting, and that always trumps everything. 8. Thank you', '2017-06-12 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7518422, 1201085, 30364, '<td valign="top">Even though I am not much inclined to want to remember Dusty Springfield with any clarity, this is a brilliant way to express your feelings about her legacy, and to drive a sparkling stake through the heart of the joyless literalism on show in this challenge.  It really is quite a beautiful photograph as well. 8. Thank you.</td>', 'Even though I am not much inclined to want to remember Dusty Springfield with any clarity, this is a brilliant way to express your feelings about her legacy, and to drive a sparkling stake through the heart of the joyless literalism on show in this challenge.  It really is quite a beautiful photograph as well. 8. Thank you.', '2017-06-12 09:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
